  "title": {
    "zh": "DIY室内堡垒插珠帐篷拼搭套装",
    "en": "DIY Indoor Fort Bead Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款面向室内互动场景的DIY堡垒插珠拼搭套装，支持通过杆件与连接件快速搭建游戏帐篷与堡垒结构，适合家庭亲子和小组互动活动。\n\n品牌为其他，材质为PP，产地深圳，支持DIY玩法，适用于常规儿童玩具渠道。",
    "en": "This is a DIY indoor fort building set designed for interactive play scenarios. Using rods and connectors, children can quickly build play tents and fort structures for family and group activities.\n\nBrand: Other. Material: PP. Origin: Shenzhen. The item supports DIY play and is suitable for standard children’s toy channels."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款DIY室内堡垒插珠帐篷拼搭套装采用杆件与连接球组合结构，适合搭建帐篷、堡垒与通道等空间造型，便于开展儿童互动游戏。",
      "产品主材为PP，支持反复拆装与DIY重构。可用于亲子互动、课堂活动和儿童活动区布置，强调动手参与和创意表达。",
      "商品采用彩盒包装，积木净重3.2KG，适用于电商零售和渠道采购场景。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This DIY indoor fort set uses a rod-and-connector-ball structure to build tents, forts, and tunnel-like shapes for children’s interactive play.",
      "The main material is PP, and the set supports repeated assembly and DIY reconfiguration. It fits parent-child interaction, classroom activities, and kids activity-area setups.",
      "Packed in a color box with a 3.2kg net block weight, the product is suitable for e-commerce retail and channel procurement."
    ]
  },
